  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Managing Invasive Species for Improved Climate Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Pacific communities to adapt to the increasing impact of invasive species with climate change:
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Pacific communities thrive, supported by healthy ecosystems (natural and agricultural);&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Pacific Island Countries (PICs) are making informed decisions and implementing actions directed at invasives management; and&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;NZ-Pacific partnerships are improving food security and reducing disaster risk through a focus on invasive species management.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
